<title>USA: Choices Entertainment completes sale.</title>
<headline>Choices Entertainment completes sale.</headline>
<dateline>MORRISVILLE, Pa. 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Choices Entertainment Corp said it has completed the sale of substantially all of its assets to West Coast Entertainment Corp.</p>
<p>When the deal was first announced in December, it was valued at $2.4 million in cash.</p>
<p>Choices operated nine video specialty stores in Pennsylvania, New Jersey and Delaware. West Coast Entertainment is a video specialty retailer based in Newtown, Pa.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
